cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the manuscript and the archived release."
title: "chemistry-framework: a configuration-driven framework for testing how molecular descriptors shape property models"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for the manuscript "Evidence before prediction: a
  configuration-driven framework for testing how molecular descriptors shape
  property models": training-partition feature evidence scorecard,
  evidence-guided descriptor recommender, modular prior/residual predictor,
  benchmark runners, archived per-split results, and the statistics scripts that
  regenerate every paired comparison reported in the manuscript.
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-19"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/soratori1025/Framework-Chemistry"
url: "https://github.com/soratori1025/Framework-Chemistry"
keywords:
  - cheminformatics
  - molecular property prediction
  - D-MPNN
  - feature selection
  - reproducible benchmark
